TIMONIALS</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;margin:0 0 12px;letter-spacing:-0.5px">What Our Clients Say</h2><p style="color:#6B7280;font-size:17px;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto">Trusted by thousands of businesses across India.</p></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));gap:24px"><div style="background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:28px;border:1px solid #F1F5F9;opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:all 0.5s;transition-delay:0s"><div style="display:flex;gap:2px;margin-bottom:16px"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#FFB800"><path d="M8 1l1.854 4.146L14 5.854l-3 2.927.708 4.127L8 10.707l-3.708 2.2L5 8.781 2 5.854l4.146-.708z"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#FFB800"><path d="M8 1l1.854 4.146L14 5.854l-3 2.927.708 4.127L8 10.707l-3.708 2.2L5 8.781 2 5.854l4.146-.708z"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#FFB800"><path d="M8 1l1.854 4.146L14 5.854l-3 2.927.708 4.127L8 10.707l-3.708 2.2L5 8.781 2 5.854l4.146-.708z"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#FFB800"><path d="M8 1l1.854 4.146L14 5.854l-3 2.927.708 4.127L8 10.707l-3.708 2.2L5 8.781 2 5.854l4.146-.708z"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#FFB800"><path d="M8 1l1.854 4.146L14 5.854l-3 2.927.708 4.127L8 10.707l-3.708 2.2L5 8.781 2 5.854l4.146-.708z"></path></svg></div><p style="color:#374151;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;font-style:italic">&quot;SarvamTax made my GST filing so simple! I used to worry about compliance every month, but now it&#x27;s just a click away. Highly recommended for all business owners!&quot;</p><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #FF6B35, #FFB800);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-w